tch resistance and better chemical resistance.","source":"R-FABRU-3542-Material-data-sheet-SAN-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07342","text":"The use of high-quality raw materials creates a 3D printer filament that is particularly easy to process.","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07345","text":"easy to print","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07346","text":"The SAN has a significantly higher strength, higher thermal resistance, higher scratch resistance and better chemical resistance.","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07347","text":"Styrene-Acrylonitrile is dishwasher safe and meets the compositional requirements of European Regulation No. 10/2011 on plastic materials intended for food contact.","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07349","text":"Dishwasher safe - High scratch resistance - Good chemical resistance - Transparency","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Pitfalls and limitations","items":[{"id":"Q04827","text":"SAN is not suitable for snap connections and should only be screwed.","source":"R-FABRU-3542-Material-data-sheet-SAN-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04828","text":"SAN is not suitable for outdoor applications.","source":"R-FABRU-3542-Material-data-sheet-SAN-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04829","text":"The material is only partially resistant to UV rays.","source":"R-FABRU-3542-Material-data-sheet-SAN-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q04830","text":"SAN is rather brittle and should not be used for applications where high impact strength is required.","source":"R-FABRU-3542-Material-data-sheet-SAN-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q05232","text":"SAN is not suitable for snap connections and should only be screwed.","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07348","text":"HIPS or ABS are more suitable for such applications.","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Warping and shrinkage","items":[{"id":"Q04831","text":"Shrinkage (ISO 294-4) 0.3-0.7 %","source":"R-FABRU-3542-Material-data-sheet-SAN-purefil","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]},{"topic":"Precision and tolerance","items":[{"id":"Q07343","text":"Very low manufacturing tolerances are achieved using a state-of-the-art manufacturing process, which leads to convincing print results with all FDM 3D printers.","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"},{"id":"Q07344","text":"low diameter and roundness tolerances","source":"D-FABRU-PUREFIL-PUREFIL-SAN-FILAMENT-309-7549-PAGE","at":"p. 1","domain":"Makers' know-how","type":"Manufacturer statement"}]}]}],"layers":[],"published":[{"property":"Melt mass-flow rate","domain":"physical","unit":"g/10 min","products":1,"lo":21,"hi":21,"median":21,"values":[21]},{"property":"Mould shrinkage","domain":"physical","unit":"%","products":1,"lo":0.3,"hi":0.7,"median":0.5,"values":[0.5]},{"property":"Vicat softening temperature","domain":"thermal","unit":"°C","products":1,"lo